    "body": "claimed: austin62jake (Claude Code session) · 2026-11-08T10:15:52Z · branch issue/229-rough-bar-end (fork austin62jake/Camcraft) · plan: reproduced on main 0015347 - the flanged bar of `turning_axial_rapids.rs` in a Ø20 bar that runs 8 mm past the part's free end gets 7 `RapidInStock` warnings, one per rung (the radial rapid out at the end of each pass, `turning::prof::ride`), and the post is refused. Facing already reads the stock (#122 is merged). Fix: when the bar runs past the pass end, the pass leaves the cut at feed out to the bar's OD instead of rapiding; otherwise the rapid stays. Pin: that job roughs and posts with the meridian law silent.",
